oding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.9 kg (1.8 lb)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 190 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  190  gp</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_SickleOfBOOOAL</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_SickleOfBOOOAL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_SickleOfBOOOAL\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">a07f2e91-e084-4fe5-9dbb-ef7de76a3c0a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a07f2e91-e084-4fe5-9dbb-ef7de76a3c0a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a07f2e91-e084-4fe5-9dbb-ef7de76a3c0a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weapon_actions\"> Weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <i>If you have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>, equip in <strong>main hand</strong> to gain:</i>\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lacerate\" title=\"Lacerate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/40px-Lacerate_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/60px-Lacerate_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/80px-Lacerate_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lacerate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/40px-Lacerate_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lacerate\" title=\"Lacerate\">Lacerate</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Slash at your target's vital points to make it <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bleed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleed</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span id=\"Condition:_BOOOAL.27s_Blessing\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_BOOOAL's_Blessing\"> Condition: BOOOAL's Blessing </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"BOOOAL's Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"BOOOAL's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"BOOOAL's Blessing (Condition)\">BOOOAL's Blessing</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The wielder has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> against <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleeding</a> creatures, as long as there are <a href=\"/wiki/Kuo-toa\" title=\"Kuo-toa\">Kuo-toa</a> to worship <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\">BOOOAL</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Festering_Cove\" title=\"The Festering Cove\">The Festering Cove</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-417&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;284</span>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pooldripp\" title=\"Pooldripp\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Pooldripp.png/25px-Portrait_Pooldripp.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Pooldripp.png/38px-Portrait_Pooldripp.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Pooldripp.png/50px-Portrait_Pooldripp.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pooldripp the Zealous\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Pooldripp.png/25px-Portrait_Pooldripp.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Pooldripp.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pooldripp\" title=\"Pooldripp\">Pooldripp the Zealous</a> or given to the player character by <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\">BOOOAL</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>To get the Sickle from Boooal, the correct dialog options must be chosen to cause his power to falter, and then the player character must agree to be his Chosen.</li>\n<li>When first acquired, the weapon has the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"BOOOAL's Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"BOOOAL's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"BOOOAL's Blessing (Condition)\">BOOOAL's Blessing</a> condition attached, but it disappears after long resting with the weapon in the inventory. This can be avoided by dropping or stashing it in a container prior to each long rest.\n<ul><li>This condition is equivalent to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Benediction_(Condition)\" title=\"BOOOAL's Benediction (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"BOOOAL's Benediction\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Benediction_(Condition)\" title=\"BOOOAL's Benediction (Condition)\">BOOOAL's Benediction</a> that can be acquired permanently from BOOOAL.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Choosing other dialog options during the cutscene allows you to kill <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\">BOOOAL</a> without the <a href=\"/wiki/Kuo-toa\" title=\"Kuo-toa\">Kuo-toa</a> attacking. Once accomplished, you can purchase the weapon from <a href=\"/wiki/Pooldripp_the_Zealous\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pooldripp the Zealous\">Pooldripp the Zealous</a>. This can only be done during the initial conversation with Pooldripp after killing BOOOAL, after this you will not be able to barter with him again.</li>\n<li>The Sickle of BOOOAL deals 2d4 damage, compared to the 1d4 of a normal <a href=\"/wiki/Sickle\" title=\"Sickle\">Sickle</a>.</li>\n<li>Using the Sickle of BOOOAL as a Monk Weapon will <i>not</i> increase the damage die. It will remain 2d4.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 202px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 200px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sickle_of_BOOOAL_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Appearance in game\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_ingame.png/300px-Sickle_of_BOOOAL_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_ingame.png/450px-Sickle_of_BOOOAL_ingame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/12/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_ingame.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Appearance in game\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_ingame.png/300px-Sickle_of_BOOOAL_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Appearance in game</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 358px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 356px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Selena-t-st-boooalsickle.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Model/render by Selena Tobin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Selena-t-st-boooalsickle.jpg/534px-Selena-t-st-boooalsickle.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Selena-t-st-boooalsickle.jpg/800px-Selena-t-st-boooalsickle.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Selena-t-st-boooalsickle.jpg/1067px-Selena-t-st-boooalsickle.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Model/render by Selena Tobin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Selena-t-st-boooalsickle.jpg/534px-Selena-t-st-boooalsickle.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Selena-t-st-boooalsickle.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Model/render by Selena Tobin</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195841\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.121 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.128 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4397/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 57305/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12580/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1978/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.030/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1483689/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  101.236      1 Template:WeaponPage\n100.00%  101.236      1 -total\n 25.37%   25.683     43 Template:Trim\n 24.44%   24.741     15 Template:Icon_text\n 15.73%   15.923      9 Template:Icon_link\n 10.56%   10.687      2 Template:Uid\n  9.07%    9.179     10 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  8.73%    8.836      2 Template:Cond\n  8.51%    8.620     16 Template:Ifempty\n  7.24%    7.327      1 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3708-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195841 and revision id 293883. Rendering was triggered b